# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the image needs. Everything is
# left out first, then the files the Dockerfile copies are let back in by name.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
!resources/bearing_catalogs/README.md
!resources/bearing_catalogs/common_bearings_catalog.json

# Asset health ledger: operator data, never baked into an image
data/ledger/

# Python bytecode inside src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]

# Exclusions that must win over the re-includes above go below this line.

# Model weight files, in any folder (the optional forecasting model's weights
# stay on the operator's machine): after every re-include, so they win.
**/*.safetensors
**/*.bin
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
